  // questions over different periods: Cost Explorer reports what was billed over
  // a closed window, Cost Optimization Hub a modelled rate for a month that has
  // not happened. Reading the window and metric off resource_cost regardless of
  // the active source would stamp Cost Explorer's billed period onto a modelled
  // figure that never covered it — a real period attached to the wrong number,
  // which is the fabrication the honesty guardrails exist to prevent. It also
  // supplies the noun, so a modelled rate is never labelled "spend".
