    // account rollup, whose window is a calendar month and is labelled as one —
    // "2026-06 (12 of 30 days)" tells a reader how much of the month they are
    // looking at. The resource-level pass asks for a rolling 14 days ending
    // yesterday and labels it with both endpoints, which already says the
    // period exactly. Measuring it against the month of its start date reports
    // a fraction of a month the window does not sit inside: a scan on the 10th
